<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SFE wheat futures see no trades.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SFE wheat futures see no trades.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wheat futures trading saw no activity on Monday.</p>
<p>March wheat saw open interest decline to 214 from 219 on Friday, while open interest in the May contract rose to 93 from 76.</p>
<p>The market was taking a break after posting modest gains on Friday, one grains trader said.</p>
